157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The size of the new high school will be based primarily on projected student enrollment. The Connecticut Department of Administrative Services allows school construction projects to be designed for the highest projected enrollment within an eight-year period. Currently, our highest projected enrollment is approximately 1,850 students. Based on that projection, we anticipate the new high school will be approximately 350,000 - 375,000 square feet. The final square footage submitted to the State will be determined through the Educational Specifications process.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
