/E (Because the State will not formally approve these increases until after the referendum, they cannot be guaranteed before the vote. However, voters should understand the potential for the State to fund more than 82% of the eligible project costs.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
