/P 124 0 R
/E (Please note that these figures convey the overall magnitude of state funding. We cannot present the final estimated project cost at the time of this document's publication. Thus, figures are for illustrative purposes only based on a preliminary total project budget of $365 - $385 million. The total project budget will be dependent upon the square footage in the finalized Educational Specifications. South Windsor's share is also not a final number. South Windsor's share will increase or decrease based on several variables yet to be determined. These variables include costs that are ineligible for reimbursement, the approval of a space standard waiver, refreshed enrollment projections, and the potential for an additional increase in state support as described in further detail below. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
